# The devcontainer build context is the repository root (compose sets
# `context: ..` relative to .devcontainer/), so these patterns are matched
# against the root. Docker's matcher does not descend into subdirectories for
# a bare name, hence the `**/` prefixes — `**/` also matches zero directories,
# so each pattern covers the top level as well as nested paths.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/build
**/dist
**/.mcp
**/.vscode
